// HumanityOS Quest Chain: Getting Started
//
// A SATISFIABLE starter chain that uses only the wired gameplay loops:
//   - Gather objectives → checked against live inventory (ore comes from the
//     drone on the Inventory page's Mining section, or the trading post).
//   - Craft objectives  → satisfied by the quest-progress event CraftingSystem
//     emits on completion ("craft_<recipe_id>"). Make objectives count units
//     of an item made by ANY recipe ("make_<item_id>", one per unit), so the
//     iron step below takes coal or graphite alike. All recipes used here are
//     skill_level <= 1 (the free starter tier), so a fresh player can complete them.
//
// As of v0.746 Build objectives fire too (the Crafting page's Structures
// section pushes build_<blueprint_id> events), so the construction chain is
// completable; as of v0.748 quests can also be ACCEPTED from the Quests page
// and grant xp_rewards. gs_first_steps is auto-accepted on spawn; completing
// it auto-accepts gs_toolsmith (prerequisite chaining), and completing that
// accepts Build First Habitat (data/quests/tutorial.ron), so the HUD's quest
// line never goes blank between them. Each completion posts a notice saying
// what it gave and what comes next (2026-10-04).
//
// A step's text is the HUD's quest line, shown as "<text> (1/2)" and cut at 64
// characters (src/gui/pages/hud.rs): keep it under about 58, and name the place
// to go. Every shipped home (data/machines/home.ron and home_solo.ron) has the
// stations these steps use and the trading post the first one names (tests:
// every_shipped_home_has_what_the_starter_quests_need in src/machines.rs and
// the_first_step_says_where_to_get_iron_ore in src/systems/quests/mod.rs).
//
// Format: Vec<QuestDef>, see src/systems/quests/mod.rs
[
    (
        id: "gs_first_steps",
        name: "First Steps",
        description: "Get your production loop going: acquire raw ore, then refine your first metal.",
        steps: [
            (
                description: "Get 3 iron ore: Inventory > Mining, or the trading post",
                objective: Gather(item_id: "iron_ore_0", quantity: 3),
            ),
            (
                description: "Smelt an iron ingot at a smelter (with coal or graphite)",
                objective: Make(item_id: "iron_ingot_0", quantity: 1),
            ),
        ],
        rewards: [
            ("iron_ingot_0", 2),
        ],
        xp_rewards: [
            ("metalworking", 30),
        ],
        prerequisite: None,
    ),
    (
        id: "gs_toolsmith",
        name: "Toolsmith",
        description: "Put your metal to work, forge your first hand tool.",
        steps: [
            (
                description: "Forge a hammer",
                objective: Craft(recipe_id: "craft_hammer", quantity: 1),
            ),
        ],
        rewards: [
            ("wood_plank_0", 4),
        ],
        xp_rewards: [
            ("metalworking", 20),
            ("woodworking", 10),
        ],
        prerequisite: Some("gs_first_steps"),
    ),
]
